tween games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.", "observed_result": "Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.", "observed_sample_and_power": "523 cells; 440 pairs", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-033", "label": "Study family SF-APPM-033: Sequential conditioning premiums (CUT->PULL_UP etc.)", "score": 0.488, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-019 (0.74); FAM:SF-APPM-033 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-019", "request matches DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions (0.73); FAM:SF-APPM-033 auto_uses_dataset DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Sequential conditioning premiums (CUT->PULL_UP etc.)", "auto_outcome_status": "inconclusive", "observed_hypothesis": "Specific play-type sequences carry a PPP premium (e.g. CUT->PULL_UP +0.065, PUTBACK->TRANSITION +0.084).", "observed_result": "Premiums CUT->PULL_UP +0.065, PUTBACK->TRANSITION +0.084, Brown DRIVE->Tatum PNR +0.326 later removed: 'doesn't hold up'.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Slide notes 'Sequence premiums - Removed - doesn't hold up'; reason not stated in files read.", "observed_sample_and_power": "NOT_RECORDED", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NO